{60}{From what I was told, it was just another import-export company that was getting by. At least until we had that big flood about a couple years ago. It washed away most of the buildings here but left this one standing. It also left so much gravel and rocks that it choked the docks.}{From what I was told, it was just another import-export company that was getting by. At least until we had that big flood about a couple years ago. It washed away most of the buildings here but left this one standing. It also left so much gravel and rocks that it choked the docks.}{}{}{}{}
